 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, July to August and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years. In 2025, August to September on the middle came in at 60% of normal. Every grid had its driest year in 1965, and grid 26913 fell to 69% of normal that year.</p>"}
